WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.444 --> 00:00:03.926
Hi there!

2
00:00:03.946 --> 00:00:12.270
[s@Hi there!

3
00:00:14.531 --> 00:00:15.492
Who are you?

4
00:00:17.613 --> 00:00:18.674
I'm a polar bear.

5
00:00:21.335 --> 00:00:22.095
I'm a mammal.

6
00:00:25.857 --> 00:00:26.878
Where do you live?

7
00:00:28.539 --> 00:00:30.500
We live around the Arctic Ocean.

8
00:00:32.404 --> 00:00:34.426
We like the ice along the coast.

9
00:00:36.188 --> 00:00:37.949
The Arctic is cold!

10
00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.112
Our thick fur keeps us warm.

11
00:00:42.553 --> 00:00:44.054
Even our paws have fur.

12
00:00:46.196 --> 00:00:48.198
We also have a layer of fat.

13
00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:51.901
Can you swim?

14
00:00:51.921 --> 00:00:55.505
Polar bears are great swimmers!

15
00:00:57.126 --> 00:00:59.008
We use our big paws for that.

16
00:01:01.084 --> 00:01:03.005
We can swim very far.

17
00:01:05.845 --> 00:01:07.106
Who do you live with?

18
00:01:09.226 --> 00:01:11.067
Most polar bears live alone.

19
00:01:13.508 --> 00:01:15.228
Sometimes we eat together.

20
00:01:17.089 --> 00:01:17.849
What do you eat?

21
00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:20.129
We eat lots of seals.

22
00:01:20.149 --> 00:01:21.310
They have lots of fat.

23
00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:31.656
We eat more fat than meat.

24
00:01:31.676 --> 00:01:33.057
How do you catch seals?

25
00:01:34.977 --> 00:01:37.078
We wait next to holes in the ice.

26
00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.299
Seals come up for air.

27
00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:44.040
Then we attack!

28
00:01:48.022 --> 00:01:49.262
I see a hole in the ice.

29
00:01:50.862 --> 00:01:55.284
Good-bye. Bye, Polar Bear!
